<title>UK: London gold ends easier, tone bearish.</title>
<headline>London gold ends easier, tone bearish.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed slightly easier at $379.10/$379.60 vs $380.35/$380.85 previously. Volumes light. Direction unclear but $378.00 may hold downside. Resistance at $380.50. Tone bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended two cents off at $4.90/$4.92. Tone very bearish and could be chased lower.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished quiet at $382.70/$383.70, down $1.55.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed down $1.25 at $119.25/$120.25.</p>
</text>
